{"_id": "Academic--scholarly_events--p--70472", "text": "{\n    \"event_name\": \"International Conference on AI and Machine Learning\",\n    \"organizers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Anya Sharma\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Stanford University\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Professor Ben Carter\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"MIT\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"event_date\": \"2024-10-26\",\n    \"venue\": \"Boston Convention and Exhibition Center\",\n    \"agenda\": \"Key topics include deep learning, natural language processing, computer vision, and reinforcement learning. Workshops and poster sessions will also be held.\",\n    \"attendees\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"University of California, Berkeley\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Bob Williams\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Carnegie Mellon University\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sponsors\": [\n        \"Google\",\n        \"Microsoft\",\n        \"Amazon\"\n    ],\n    \"keynote_speakers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Fei-Fei Li\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Stanford University\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Yoshua Bengio\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"University of Montreal\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"registration_link\": \"https://www.example.com/icai2024\"\n}"}
{"_id": "Academic--scholarly_events--n--70472", "text": "{\n    \"event_name\": \"AI for Beginners Workshop\",\n    \"organizers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Sarah Miller\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Local Tech Community\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"event_date\": \"2024-07-15\",\n    \"venue\": \"Online (Zoom)\",\n    \"agenda\": \"Introduction to AI concepts, basic Python programming, and simple machine learning algorithms. Designed for students with no prior experience.\",\n    \"attendees\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Charlie Brown\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"High School Student\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Diana Davis\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Community College\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sponsors\": [\n        \"Google\",\n        \"Codecademy\"\n    ],\n    \"keynote_speakers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Emily Wilson\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Codecademy Instructor\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"registration_link\": \"https://www.example.com/aiworkshop\"\n}"}
{"_id": "Academic--scholarly_events--p--70473", "text": "{\n    \"event_name\": \"AI Frontiers Conference 2024\",\n    \"organizers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Association for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"AAAI\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"event_date\": \"2024-11-22\",\n    \"venue\": \"ExCeL London\",\n    \"agenda\": \"The conference will explore the latest breakthroughs in artificial intelligence, including deep learning, natural language processing, and robotics. Sessions will cover ethical considerations and future trends.\",\n    \"attendees\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Anya Sharma\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"University of Oxford\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Ben Carter\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"DeepMind\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sponsors\": [\n        \"Google\",\n        \"Microsoft Research\",\n        \"NVIDIA\"\n    ],\n    \"keynote_speakers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Fei-Fei Li\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Stanford University\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"registration_link\": \"https://www.aifrontiers.com/register\"\n}"}
{"_id": "Academic--scholarly_events--n--70473", "text": "{\n    \"event_name\": \"Machine Learning Workshop - London\",\n    \"organizers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"London Machine Learning Group\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"LMLG\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"event_date\": \"2024-11-18\",\n    \"venue\": \"University College London\",\n    \"agenda\": \"A hands-on workshop covering the fundamentals of machine learning with Python. Focus will be on practical application of algorithms.\",\n    \"attendees\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Chloe Davis\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Imperial College London\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"David Evans\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Bloomberg\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sponsors\": [\n        \"DataCamp\",\n        \"Anaconda\"\n    ],\n    \"keynote_speakers\": [],\n    \"registration_link\": \"https://lmlg.org/workshop\"\n}"}
{"_id": "Academic--scholarly_events--p--70474", "text": "{\n    \"event_name\": \"International Conference on Advanced AI\",\n    \"organizers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Anya Sharma\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Stanford University\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Professor Kenji Tanaka\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"University of Tokyo\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"event_date\": \"2024-11-15\",\n    \"venue\": \"Massachusetts Institute of Technology, Cambridge, MA\",\n    \"agenda\": \"This conference will explore the latest advancements in generative AI, reinforcement learning, and explainable AI, with a focus on practical applications and ethical considerations. Key topics include large language models, AI safety, and the future of work.\",\n    \"attendees\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Google AI\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Bob Williams\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"OpenAI\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sponsors\": [\n        \"Google\",\n        \"Microsoft\",\n        \"Amazon Web Services\"\n    ],\n    \"keynote_speakers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Fei-Fei Li\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Stanford University\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"registration_link\": \"https://www.advancedai.org/register\"\n}"}
{"_id": "Academic--scholarly_events--n--70474", "text": "{\n    \"event_name\": \"European Symposium on Machine Learning\",\n    \"organizers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Isabelle Dubois\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Sorbonne University\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Professor Klaus Richter\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Technical University of Munich\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"event_date\": \"2024-06-20\",\n    \"venue\": \"University of Oxford, Oxford, UK\",\n    \"agenda\": \"A broad overview of machine learning techniques, covering supervised, unsupervised, and reinforcement learning. Focus will be on theoretical foundations and applications in diverse fields.\",\n    \"attendees\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Carlos Hernandez\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Barcelona Tech Lab\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Sophie Martin\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"INRIA\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sponsors\": [\n        \"Siemens\",\n        \"SAP\"\n    ],\n    \"keynote_speakers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Jürgen Schmidhuber\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"IDSIA\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"registration_link\": \"https://www.eurosymml.org/register\"\n}"}
{"_id": "Academic--scholarly_events--p--70475", "text": "{\n    \"event_name\": \"International Conference on Advanced AI\",\n    \"organizers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Stanford University\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Department of Computer Science\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"MIT\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Computer Science and Artificial Intelligence Laboratory\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"event_date\": \"2024-11-15\",\n    \"venue\": \"Boston, MA\",\n    \"agenda\": \"Deep Learning, Reinforcement Learning, Natural Language Processing, Computer Vision, Artificial Intelligence Ethics\",\n    \"attendees\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Yoshua Bengio\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"University of Montreal\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Fei-Fei Li\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"Stanford University\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"sponsors\": [\n        \"National Science Foundation\",\n        \"Amazon Web Services\",\n        \"Microsoft Research\"\n    ],\n    \"keynote_speakers\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Dr. Yann LeCun\",\n            \"affiliation\": \"New York University\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"registration_link\": \"https://www.example.com/ai-conference-2024\"\n}"}
